      "message": "Just thinking aloud: shouldn\u0027t such page alignment checks be done by __pkvm_host_donate_hyp() itself, instead of this donate_host_memory() wrapper? i.e. shouldn\u0027t we just require page alignment for all donations?\n\nIt seems that a non-aligned donation always means a bug: the host expects to still have access to the rest of the page, but it will not have access to it, since the entire page was donated to the hypervisor?\n\nSomething to consider for v6.15...",
